section.section-compact.shell aria-labelledby="ai-agents"
  div.section-heading
    div
      span.eyebrow AI agents
      h2#ai-agents Better tools for coding agents.
    p I build reusable skills and repository harnesses that give AI agents project context, a clear workflow, and explicit verification steps. Review and engineering judgment stay part of the process.
  div.project-grid
    article.project-card
      div.project-card-body
        div.project-card-topline
          span.project-number 01
          span.project-kind AI agent skill · Ruby on Rails
        h3 Rails Update
        p A reusable skill for Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex that guides Ruby and Rails upgrades through compatibility repairs, framework defaults, behavioral checks, and data and release safeguards.
        ul.tag-list aria-label="Rails Update focus"
          li.tag Ruby on Rails
          li.tag Modernization
          li.tag Verification
        div.button-row
          a.button.button-secondary href="https://github.com/mpakus/rails-update" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" Explore the Rails Update skill
    article.project-card
      div.project-card-body
        div.project-card-topline
          span.project-number 02
          span.project-kind Repository harness · Elixir / Phoenix
        h3 Elixir + Phoenix Codex Harness
        p A reusable repository harness for AI agents building Elixir/Phoenix applications. A short AGENTS.md connects focused architecture, Ecto, LiveView, security, testing, and operations guidance, with scripts to check the harness.
        ul.tag-list aria-label="Elixir and Phoenix harness focus"
          li.tag Elixir
          li.tag Phoenix
          li.tag Agent workflows
        div.button-row
          a.button.button-secondary href="https://github.com/mpakus/harness-elixir" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" Explore the Elixir/Phoenix harness
